1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Claude ll Seigneur de Mascias, de la Chapelle (de Villiers) Birthdate: circa 1520 Birthplace: St. Martin-du-Lac, Saône-et-Loire , Bourgogne, France Death: 1610 (84-94) Bourgogne, France Immediate Family: Son of Gui
