2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Claude ll
2 CONT
2 CONT When Claude ll de Villiers , Seigneur de Mascais, de la Chapelle was born in 1520, in Saint-Martin-du-Lac, Saône-et-Loire, Bourgogne-Franche-Comté, France, his father, Guillaume de Villiers, was 46 and his mother, Blanche de Dreux
2 CONC , was 32. He married Anne De Fay on 30 July 1591, in France. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. He died about 1610, in Bourgogne, Reims, Marne, Champagne-Ardenne, France, at the age of 91.
