1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GC1Q-4R8
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Desrosiers was born about 16 June 1650, in Trois-Rivières, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Anthoine Desrosiers, was 32 and her mother, Anne Duhérisson, was 19. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexandre Raux "Raoul" on 19 February 1664, in Assumption Cathedral, Trois-Rivières, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT Joseph Raux 1669–1734
2 CONT Marie Anne Raux 1673–1734
2 CONT Jean RAOULT 1675–1750
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Rault 1676–1693
2 CONT Jeanne Raux 1678–1709
2 CONT Marie-Claire Raouls 1680–1756
2 CONT Marie Magdelaine Raoult 1682–1686
2 CONT Michel Morinville Rault. 1684–1750
2 CONT Madeleine Raoult 1685–
2 CONT Magdelaine Raoult 1686–1686 [possible duplicate entry]
2 CONT Marie Francoise Rault 1687–1688
2 CONT Alex Raoult 1690–
2 CONT Alexis Raux 1691–1762
2 CONT
2 CONT She died about 28 November 1722, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, at the age of 72, and was buried in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
