1 NOTE Married 20 Jan 1682 Marie-Francoise Dandonneau [#1325] (dau. of Pierre & Francoise Robin, bap. 4 Jan 1665 at Trois-Rivieres) at Champlain, Quebec, Canada; sources: family (10 children) is listed in Jette pg 348; a short bio of Ant
2 CONC oine Desrosiers acquired from the internet (copy filed 29-2); Tanguay Vol I pg 192 shows a family of 9 children; Tanguay Vol I pg 155; <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/desrosiers.htm< (copy filed 29-2 also in his father's internal
2 CONC  textfile).
2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 192 shows Marie-Francoise remarried 26 Nov 1705 to Henri Bellisle at Cahmplain.
2 CONT Ancestry.com download named 28817.ged (copy filed 29-2; 46-6).
2 CONT <http://www.grandesfamilles.org/Desrosiers/02.html> shows this family with 10 children.
2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 192; Vol III pg 396.
2 CONT 1666 census of Trois-Rivieres shows him age 8.
2 CONT "The Grand Families" from the internet (copy filed 29-2).
2 CONT <http://home.attbi.com/~sodapop68/webtree/pafg21.htm> (copy filed 29-2).
2 CONT A short bio of Antoine Desrosiers acquired from the internet (copy filed 29-2).
