2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.leveillee.net/ancestry/d674.htm>.
2 CONT
2 CONT TENTH GENERATION
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste DESROSIERS was born in 1657. He married Françoise Marie Perrine (Petronelle) DANDONNEAU on 20 Jan 1682 in Champlain, Province de Québec. He died on 23 Feb 1704. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Françoise Petronelle DANDONNEAU was born on 4 Jan 1665. After her first husband died in 1704, she married Henri BELLISLE on 21 Nov 1705 in Trois-Rivières, Québec. She was also known as Jeanne LAFERRIRE. She died 8 May 1711 in Ste-
2 CONC Anne-de-Détroit. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Jean Baptiste was born 23 Oct 1682 in Champlain. He married Marie Barbe BOUSQUET 17 Nov 1709 in Montréal. He died 3 Apr 1719 in Montréa. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Michel was born 24 Mar 1685 in Champlain. He married Jeanne Marie Anne MOREAU 28 Mary 1716 in Rimouski. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Joseph Marie was born 12 Mar 1687 in Champlain. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Marie Françoise was born 2 May 1690 and died 11 Nov 1691 in Champlain. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Jacques was born 22 Jan 1692 in Champlain. He died 9 May 1723 in Kashaskia. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Marie Angélique was born before 1693. She married Louis COTTENOIR 20 Nov 1715 in Sorel. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Louis was born 26 Apr 1695 in Champlain. He married Marie Thérèse FAFARD LONVAL 24 May 1723 in Sorel. He died 23 Feb 1750 in L'le-Dupas. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. Marie Madeleine was born 24 Apr 1697 in Champlain. She married Michel LAMY DEFOND 9 Feb 1723 in Sorel. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. Josephe Marie Catherine was born 31 Aug 1700 in Champlain. She married Antoine COTTENOIR PREVILLE 14 Nov 1724 in Sorel. She died 3 Mar 1764 in L'le-Dupas. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT x. Antoine DESROSIERS was born on 13 Mar 1702 in Champlain. He married Marie Anne STYVES 22 May 1725 in Montréal. He died 9 Oct and was buried 10 Oct 1754 in Sorel, Québec. He was also known as DEROSIERS aka DUTREMBLE. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. Bonaventure was born 24 Jun 1703 in Champlain. He married Marie Marguerite ANGO DURIVAGE before 31 Dec 1749. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES:
2 CONT (1) PRDH, Acte de mariage No. 6986.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) Ibid., Acte de famille No. 755
2 CONT
2 CONT (3) Ibid., Acte de famille No. 5176.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
