1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L6CV-ZJM
2 CONT Brief Life History of Antoine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Antoine DesRosiers was born on 30 August 1664, in Trois-Rivières, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, his father, Anthoine Desrosers II, was 46 and his mother, Anne Duhérisson, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Renée Lepellé on 26 November 1696, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1731, at the age of 67, his occupation is listed as officier de milice. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before 30 January 1742, in Canada, New France.
