1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Sources:'''
2 CONT **https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_governors_of_Acadia
2 CONT **https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simon-Pierre_Denys_de_Bonaventure
2 CONT **https://www.biographi.ca/en/bio/denys_de_bonaventure_simon_pierre_2F.html
