1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZ68-5NB
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Anne
2 CONT '''
2 CONT When Marie Anne Raux/Raoul was born about 1673, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Alexandre Raux "Raoul", was 42 and her mother, Marie Desrosiers, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Nicolas Toutant on 18 August 1686, in Notre-Dame-de-la-Visitation-de-Champlain, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Daniel Toutant 1688–
2 CONT Joseph Toutant 1691–1762
2 CONT Daniel Toutant 1693–
2 CONT Marie Anne Toutant 1696–1742
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Toutant 1699–1776
2 CONT Marie Toutant 1702–1778
2 CONT Pierre Toutant 1703–1760
2 CONT Marie Geneviève Toutant 1706–1746
2 CONT Michel Toutant 1708–1708
2 CONT Elisabeth Toutant 1710–1749
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 30 July 1734, in her hometown, at the age of 62, and was buried in Notre-Dame-de-la-Visitation, Champlain, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada.
