1 NOTE Additional reference: 4-16.
2 CONT Married 30 Jan 1703 to Jean Baptiste Toupin (he born 30 June 1678 at Neuville, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, bur. 18 Feb 1724 at Batiscan, son of Jean & Marie Gloria - source: Tanguay Vol I pg 570) at Champlain; sources: Jette pg 1085
2 CONC ; Tanguay Vol I pg 576; Drouin pg 1291; (c 29 Normandin); family (9 children) is listed in Jette pg 1085; Tanguay Vol VII pg 323 shows family with 12 children; <www.my.ged.com> "The Turcotte/Pratte Family Tree" (copy filed 2-16) s
2 CONC hows a family of 6 children; he remarried 1 Feb 1724 to Marie Francoise Delisle with no children, source Tanguay Vol VII pg 323.
2 CONT Add'l info acquired from the net (copy filed 2-16) shows a marrige 30 Jan 1703 to Jean-Baptiste Toupin aka Dussault at Notre Dame de la Visitation, Champlain, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT NOTE: This Jean Baptiste is a half brother to the Jean Baptiste who married #103 (in this group).
2 CONT Drouin genealogy from the internet (copy filed 2-16) shows information in conflict with #98 in both date of death and marriage information.
2 CONT <http://www.neighbors.com/ispusers/tonyn/genealogy/d0001/f0000026.html>   (copy filed 2-16).
1 NOTE Additional reference: 4-16.
2 CONT Married 26 Feb 1712 Francois Rivard (he born 11 Apr 1691 and died 01 Mar 1723 at Batiscan, Quebec, Canada, son of Pierre & Catherine Trotier, he remarried 18 Sep 1724 to Marie Renee Caron) at Batiscan; have record, see "Marriages 
2 CONC of Batiscan, Quebec, Q." pg 26; sources: family (7 children) is listed in Jette pg 989; Tanguay Vol VI pg 577 shows 2 families with 6+9 children; (c 26 Trottain); <www.my.ged.com>  "The Turcotte/Pratte Family Tree" (copy filed 2-1
2 CONC 6) shows a family of 8 children; Tanguay Vol  I pg 576.
2 CONT Jette pg 1085;1086;1099.
2 CONT Family group sheet of #98 acquired from Sue Rood (copy filed Sue Rood's papers).
2 CONT Drouin genealogy from the internet (copy filed 2-16) shows a conflict with #99 on date of death and marriage information
2 CONT <http://www.neighbors.com/ispusers/tonyn/genealogy/d0001/f0000026.html>   (copy filed 2-16).
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://awt.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=:2799272&id=I24060&ti=5538>.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Marie Madeleine TURCOT (Jaques TURCOT3, Jean TURCOT2, FRANCOIS TURCOT1) was born 1685 in Champlain, and died 8 MAY 1724 in Champlain. She married Francois RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE 26 FEB 1712 in Batiscan,Champlain, son of Pierre RIVA
2 CONC RD DIT LAVIGNE and Catherine TROTTIER. He was born 11 APR 1691 in Batiscan,Champlain, was christened 20 APR 1691 in Batiscan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Marie Madeleine TURCOT and Francois RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE is:+ 4   i. Louise Catherine RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE was born 1712 in Champlain.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. MARIE MADELEINE (Jaques TURCOT3, Jean TURCOT2, FRANCOIS TURCOT1) was born 1685 in Champlain,PQ,Canada, and died 8 MAY 1724 in Champlain,PQ,Canada. She married FRANCOIS RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE 26 FEB 1711 in Batiscan,Champlain,PQ,Can
2 CONC ada, son of PIERRE RIVARD DIT LANOUETTE and CATHERINE TROTIER. He was born 11 APR 1691 in Batiscan,Champlain,PQ,Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of MARIE MADELEINE and FRANCOIS RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE is:+ 5   i. MARIE LOUISE CATHERINE RIVARD DIT LAVIGNE was born 26 FEB 1712 in St. Pierre les Becquets,Nicolet,Quebec, and died 12 NOV 1756 in St. Pierre les Becquets,Nicolet
2 CONC ,Quebec.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
