1 NOTE Additional reference: 4-16.
2 CONT Married 2 Mar 1715 Jean Baptise Toupin (born 27 Feb 1690 at Pte-aux-Trembles, Q., son of Jean-Baptiste & Marie Madeleine Mezeray) at Champlain; sources: Tanguay Vol VII pg 324; Drouin pg 1291.  Family (10 children) is listed in Ta
2 CONC nguay Vol VII pg 324; Tanguay Vol I pg 570; (c 02 Trottain); family (9 children) is listed in Jette pg 1085-1086; he remarried 25 Oct 1744 to Marie Anne Chapelain with no children; a short bio of Jean Turcot acquired from the inte
2 CONC rnet (copy filed 28-2); <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/TurcotJ.htm> (copy filed 28-2 also in her father's internal textfile).
2 CONT PRDH shows the following concerning the above marriage:
2 CONT Union 1715-03-02 Champlain TOUPIN-DUSSAULT JEAN BAPTISTE & TURCOT
2 CONT MARIE-THERESE
2 CONT s/o  Union 1688-06-21 Neuville  TOUPIN-DUSSAULT  JEAN-BAPTISTE &  MEZERAY
2 CONT MARIE-MADELEINE
2 CONT d/o Union 1674-04-04 Lieu indéterminé (au Québec)  TURCOT JACQUES &
2 CONT DESROSIERS MARIE-ANNE
2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 576.
2 CONT NOTE: This Jean Baptiste is a half brother of the Jean Baptiste that married #99 (in this group).
2 CONT Drouin genealogy from the internet (copy filed 2-16).
2 CONT <http://www.neighbors.com/ispusers/tonyn/genealogy/d0001/f0000026.html>   (copy filed 2-16).
2 CONT <www.my.ged.com>  "The Turcotte/Pratte Family Tree" (copy filed 2-16).
2 CONT <http://pages.infinit.net/lucbm/boulanger/1770_boulanger.htm> (copy filed 2-16) shows an ancestry of Marie Therese Turcot.
2 CONT <http://pages.infinit.net/lucbm/boulanger/110_boulanger.htm> (copy filed 2-16) shows a descendancy of Marie and her husband.
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from <http://membres.lycos.fr/ancetre/TurcotJ.htm>; it is only one paragraph of this article.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Gloria décède le 12 novembre 1687, en laissant sept enfants. Jean-Baptiste épouse en secondes noces, le 21 juin 1688, Marie-Madeleine Mezeray, fille de Jean Mezeray et Madeleine Masse. L'aîné, Jean-Baptiste, né le 27 février
2 CONC  1690, aux Écureuils, baptisé le lendemain à Neuville, tisse le lien de généalogie, en épousant le 2 mars 1715, Marie-Thérèse Turcot, fille de Jacques Turcot et d'Anne Desrosiers.
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------
