1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHGD-ZL7
2 CONT Brief Life History of Alexis'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Alexis Desrosiers dit Lafrenière was born on 7 November 1715, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Antoine DesRosiers, was 51 and his mother, Marie Renée Lepellé, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Agathe Bigot on 30 January 1742, in Champlain, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 22 August 1784, in his hometown, at the age of 68, and was buried in Berthier-en-Haut, Montreal, Quebec, British North America.
