1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KCPD-FQH
2 CONT Brief Life History of Antoine Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Antoine Pierre Lepellé  Desmarais was born on 25 June 1721, in District Judiciaire de Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada, his father, Antoine Lepellé Desmarais, was 52 and his mother, Barbe Godefroy, was 43. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Claire Lefebvre Laciseray on 10 January 1752, in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 October 1801, in his hometown, at the age of 80.
