1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bourgeois de Caen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 27 February 1734, Caumont-sur-Orne:
2 CONT
2 CONT French text: le 27 février, 1734:
2 CONT
2 CONT "après la publication (des bans) du future mariage d'entre Thomas Grusse, sieur de la Riviere, bourgois de Caen, fils du feu François et du demoiselle Anne Daignant, et du demoiselle Marie Anne Le Pigeon, fille de feu Alexandre Ra
2 CONC vend Le Pigeon et de demoiselle Marie Anne Godefroy…"
2 CONT
2 CONT http://archives.calvados.mnesys.fr/?id=viewer&doc=accounts%2Fmnesys_cg14%2Fdatas%2Fir%2FRessources%20g%C3%A9n%C3%A9alogiques%2FEtat-civil%2FFRAD014_Etat-civil_Ablon_Ducy-Sainte-Marguerite%2Exml&page_ref=184890&lot_num=4&img_num=1&
2 CONC index_in_visu=
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: At the birth of his son, Guillaume, baptized Aug. 11, 1740, was deceased. Departmental Archives AD 14 Caumont sur Orne NMD 1685-1792, page 19/149. http://archives.calvados.mnesys.fr/?id=viewer&doc=accounts%2Fmnesys_cg14%2Fd
2 CONC atas%2Fir%2FRessources%20g%C3%A9n%C3%A9alogiques%2FEtat-civil%2FFRAD014_Etat-civil_Ablon_Ducy-Sainte-Marguerite%2Exml&page_ref=184890&lot_num=4&img_num=1&index_in_visu=
2 CONT
2 CONT "Guillaume
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Not to be confused with another person, Thomas François Grusse de la Rivière, son of Francois, deceased at the age of 8 on July 16, 1744. Departmental Archives: : AD 14 CAUMONT SUR ORNE NMD 1685-1792 VUE 50/149. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''
