1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/M1PW-S1Y
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Anne'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Anne Toutant was born on 1 January 1696, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Nicolas Toutant, was 43 and her mother, Marie Anne Raux, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Michel Bigot on 22 November 1717, in Trois-Rivières, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT Michel Bigot 1721–
2 CONT Marie Anne Bigot 1722–1785
2 CONT Marie Agathe Bigot 1724–1787
2 CONT Marie Josephe Bigot (1) 1725–1725
2 CONT Joseph Bigot 1726–
2 CONT Alexis Joseph Bigot dit Dorval Sr. 1727–1787
2 CONT Marie Josephe Bigot (2) 1728–1728
2 CONT Michel-Ignace Bigot 1729–1812
2 CONT Pierre Bigot (1) 1730–1730
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Bigot 1731–
2 CONT Pierre Bigot (2) 1733–1733
2 CONT Marie Josèphe Bigot (3) 1734–1812
2 CONT Joseph Bigot 1735–1735
2 CONT Jean Pierre Bigot 1738–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 1742.
2 CONT -------------------------
2 CONT
