1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZJF-VVR
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Dubois was born on 23 October 1695, in Saint-François-Xavier-de-Batiscan, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean Dubois, was 31 and his mother, Jeanne Raux, was 18. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Francoise-Therese Rivard on 24 May 1736, in Saint-François-Xavier-de-Batiscan, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 January 1750, in his hometown, at the age of 54, and was buried in Champlain, Les Chenaux, Quebec, Canada.
