2 CONT When Ursule Amable Desrosiers was born on 28 March 1732, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Antoine Desrosiers Lafreniere, was 34 and her mother, Angelique Piette Trempe, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married François Pierre Généreux on 29 January 1753, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 1 January 1801, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 68, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
