2 CONT Brief Life History of Guillaume
2 CONT '''
2 CONT When Guillaume Desrosiers Lafreniere was born about 1750, in Quebec, Canada, his father, Alexis Desrosiers dit Lafrenière, was 36 and his mother, Marie Agathe Bigot, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Josephte Laferrière on 7 February 1774, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 3 April 1829, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 80, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
