1 NAME Antoine-Joseph /Richardville/
2 GIVN Antoine-Joseph
2 SURN Richardville
2 _MARNM Drouet de Richerville
2 NICK Joseph Richardville
1 NAME Joseph Drouet de Richerville
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 ADDR
3 CITY Trois-Rivières
3 STAE Québec
3 CTRY Canada
1 BIRT
2 DATE 30 MAR 1723
2 ADDR
3 CITY Champlain
3 STAE Quebec
3 CTRY Canada
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I've ran into quite a few genealogy sites that have Joseph (b 1723) confused with Antoine Drouet de Richerville (b 1699). Antoine was Joseph's baptismal name. He was known throughout his life as Joseph Drouet de Ri
2 CONC cherville or simplyJoseph Richardville. He is the Father of Chief Jean-Baptiste de Richardville, and the son of Denis-Didier Drouet de Richerville, who is Antoine's brother. Antoine's actual baptismal name is confusing. Is it Jose
2 CONC ph or Francois? I believe it was Francois, as that is how it is documented in the marriage record to Francoise Outelas at Kaskaskia (1756). Joseph was not married to Francoise Outelas, and did not live in Vincennes, Indiana. Howev
2 CONC er, some of his Descendants did settle in Vincennes. Please read the link to the article below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://scholarworks.iu.edu/journals/index.php/imh/article/view/10088/13887
