2 CONT
2 CONT Children:	 Elizabeth Isabelle Lalonde (born Denys De La Ronde) Michael Antoine Delaronde (born Denys de LaRonde) Marie Angelique Desmarais (born Denys de LaRonde Delaronde) Julia Boucher (born Denys de LaRonde Delaronde) Élizabeth
2 CONC -Agathe Josette Denys de LaRonde Paul David Niiohirasha Delaronde (born Denys de LaRonde) Etienne Delaronde (born Denys de LaRonde Denys dit deLaronde) Margaurite Boucher (born Denys de LaRonde Delaronde) Marie Louise Pitwanabokwe
