1 OCCU Abraham owned and farmed the following properties:-De Goede Hoop and Bossendal in DrakensteinRhenosterrug and De Leeuwendans in Wellington., Farmer at De Goede Hoop and Bossendal in Drakenstein and De Leeuwendans in Wellington Sou
