1 NAME Charles Stanislas (Stanislaus) /Dagneau de Quindre dit Fontenay/
2 GIVN Charles Stanislas (Stanislaus)
2 SURN Dagneau de Quindre dit Fontenay
2 _MARNM Dagneau de Quindre dit Fontenay
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 ADDR
3 CITY Makinac
3 STAE Michigan
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 APR 1746
2 ADDR
3 CITY St Joseph
3 STAE Quebec
3 CTRY Canada
