2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Turcot was born on 26 October 1743, in Île Dupas, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, his father, Alexis Turcot, was 30 and his mother, Madeline Duteau, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife  Pelagie Grignon (1748-1790) on 11 January 1768, in Berthierville, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 6 daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife 
2 CONT Marie-Louise Mignier dit Lagacé (1760–1826)
2 CONT On 22 April 1793 in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They had at least 5 children 
2 CONT
2 CONT  He died on 30 August 1832, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 88, and was buried in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
