1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/K2FT-4WW
2 CONT Brief Life History of Ursule Amable'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Ursule Amable Généreux was born on 7 September 1755, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, François Pierre Généreux, was 27 and her mother, Ursule Amable Desrosiers, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Beaugrand Champagne on 21 June 1773, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 13 March 1781, in Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 25, and was buried in Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
