2 CONT == Biography == '''Birth and Baptism'''≤br>  Antoine Amable Dérosier dit la Freniere was born on 19 Jul 1778 and was baptized on 20 Jul 1778 at Sainte-Genevieve de Berthier, Province de Québec.≤ref name=bapfs>[https://familysearch
2 CONC .org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-899Q-3987-X?cc=1321742&wc=HC7P-FM9%3A24139701%2C24139702%2C24139703 Baptism FamilySearch]. Québec, registresparoissiaux catholiques, 1621-1979, Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier > Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier >
2 CONC  Baptêmes, mariages, sépultures 1751-1785 > image 462 of 617; Archives Nationales du Quebec (National Archives of Quebec), Montreal.≤/ref>
2 CONT .
2 CONT
2 CONT He married [[Houle-541|Marie Houle]]  Together they had 4 children:
2 CONT # [[Lafreniere-269|Isabelle Lafreniere]]
2 CONT # [[Lafreniere-270|Antoine Lafreniere]]
2 CONT # [[Lafreniere-278|Marguerite Lafreniere]]
2 CONT # [[Lafreniere-279|Jean Lafreniere]]
2 CONT He died on January 01, 1863.
2 CONT
