1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://greenerpasture.com/Ancestors/Details/119333
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Angélique DUCHARME dite PROVENCHER was born 5 June 1749 in Cap-de-la-Madeleine, Canada, New France . Marie-Angélique DUCHARME dite PROVENCHER was the child of Charles PROVENCHER dit DUCHARME   and   Marie-Madeleine DESROSIER
2 CONC S and the grandchild of: (paternal)  Jean-François PROVENCHER and Marguerite MOREAU (maternal)  Jean-François DESROSIERS and Marguerite DESHAYES (DESHAIES) dite ST-CYR
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse(s)/Partner(s) and Child(ren):
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Angélique  married  Jean-Baptiste CORMIER 11 January 1767 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Province of Québec, Canada .  The couple had (at least) 3 children. Jean-Baptiste CORMIER  was born abt. 1735 in Acadia, Canada (Acadie).  Jean
2 CONC -Baptiste died 23 January 1808 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Québec, Canada (Nativité-de-Notre-Dame-de-Becancour) (Saint-Edouard-de-Gentilly).  Jean-Baptiste was the child of Pierre CORMIER and Marguerite CYR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Angélique DUCHARME dite PROVENCHER died 5 May 1815 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Lower Canada . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jean-Baptiste CORMIER and Marie-Angélique DUCHARME dite PROVENCHER:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Judith CORMIER (b.3 April 1783, Bécancour, Nicolet, Province of Québec, Canada   d. , )
2 CONT m. Joseph DÉSILETS 26 July 1802 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Québec, Canada (Nativité-de-Notre-Dame-de-Becancour) (Saint-Edouard-de-Gentilly)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste CORMIER (b.June 20, 1785, Bécancour, Nicolet, Province of Québec, Canada   d. 8 January 1847, Bécancour, Nicolet, Lower Canada )
2 CONT m. Marie LACOURSE 24 January 1815 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Québec, Canada (Nativité-de-Notre-Dame-de-Becancour) (Saint-Edouard-de-Gentilly)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite CORMIER (b.26 February 1790, Bécancour, Nicolet, Province of Québec, Canada   d. 17 June 1855, Champlain, Lower Canada )
2 CONT m. Joseph HEBERT dit MANUEL 1 March 1813 in Bécancour, Nicolet, Québec, Canada (Nativité-de-Notre-Dame-de-Becancour) (Saint-Edouard-de-Gentilly)
2 CONT
