2 CONT Brief Life History of Michel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Michel Hamel was born on 10 December 1752, in Nicolet, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada, his father, François Hamel, was 31 and his mother, Catherine Daniau, was 18. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Angelique Caya on 7 February 1780, in Saint Antoine de la Baie du Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 6 daughters. 
