1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/938B-1XJ
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Fafard dit Delorme was born on 1 August 1772, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Joseph Amable Farfard Dit Delorme, was 28 and his mother, Marie Charlotte Brisset, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Geneviève Cornellier Grandchamp on 21 January 1799, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 29 May 1857, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 84.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
