1 NOTE {geni:about_me} b3 Christman Joël gedoop 1 Februarie 1728 en sterf voor 3 Maart 1743. (Die gepubliseerde bronne koppel hom verkeerdelik aan Anna Susanna van Helsdingen – sien b8 hieronder).
2 CONT
2 CONT b8 Christian Ackermann is op 20 Februarie 1699 in Kötzschen, naby Merseburg, Sakse, gebore. Hy was die seun van ds. Christian Ackermann en Maria Christiana Stenger. Alhoewel sy van meestal as Ackerman of Akkerman in ou dokumente a
2 CONC angegee word, teken hy sy naam in 1740 as C Ackermann. Sy broer en seuns teken ook hul van as Ackermann.
2 CONT
2 CONT Navorsing: Darrell Ackermann Brackenfell dackmann@iafrica.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Geboorte 1743 Kaapstad gedoop 3 Mar 1743 oorlede 1794
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT b3 Christman Joël gedoop 1 Februarie 1728 en sterf voor 3 Maart 1743.  (Die gepubliseerde bronne koppel hom verkeerdelik aan Anna Susanna van Helsdingen – sien b8 hieronder).
2 CONT
2 CONT SV/PROG Christian Ackermann is op 20 Februarie 1699 in Kötzschen, naby Merseburg, Sakse, gebore. Hy was die seun van ds. Christian Ackermann en Maria Christiana Stenger. Alhoewel sy van meestal as Ackerman of Akkerman in ou dokume
2 CONC nte aangegee word, teken hy sy naam in 1740 as C Ackermann. Sy broer en seuns teken ook hul van as Ackermann.
2 CONT
2 CONT b8 Christman Joël ACKERMAN(N) (c.3 Mar 1743-Cape Town,South Africa;d.10 Jul 1794 S,Cape,South Africa)   sp: Anna Susanna VAN HELSDINGEN (c.15 Apr 1740-CT,South Africa;m.24 Jan 1762;d.19 Feb 1798
2 CONT
2 CONT Navorsing: Darrell Ackermann Brackenfell dackmann@iafrica.com
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The references below are incorrect, as SAF is incorrect that he could have married v Helsdingen in 1762 if he passed away before 1743, when a younger brother was given the same names Christiaan Joel, and that brother married v Hel
2 CONC sdingen in 1762.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Bron 1 - Geslagregister van Vroeë  Kaapse families. b3 Christman Joël Ackerman » 1.2.1728, x Anna Susanna van Helsdingen
2 CONT #  Bron 2 - Overberg families - HJ Engela 50 b3 Christman Joel ACKERMAN (46/x), » 01.02.1728 »» Kinders (3): 51, 53, 54 x Anna Susanna VAN HELSDINGEN
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
