1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Genealogiese/Genealogical #: b3
2 CONT
2 CONT Willem Krige(o) arrived in South Africa as soldier on board "Het Vaderland" in 1721.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a builder at Jacob de Villers on "Bosch en Dal". Became "burger" in 1731. Married Janne(Johanna) de Villers , born 1697, daughter of Jacob de Villiers and Marguerite Gardiol on 14.12.1797. 4 Children. "sic." Cor Pama, Groot
2 CONC  Afrikaanse Familie Naamboek.
