2 CONT HOPPE GEORG WILHELM (S). - Lüneburg. Arr. 1768 as arquebusier, b. 1771, a hatter at Cape Town ~ (1) 25.8.1771 Magdalena Greef; (2) 3.8.1788 Maria Magdalena Victor. 5 children. + 11.9.1824 at the age of 81. (GMR 1768-71; Rq. 1771.4
