1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZ3N-JCB
2 CONT Brief Life History of Françoise'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Françoise Chouinard was born on 5 October 1796, in Saint-Louis-de-Kamouraska, Cornwallis, Lower Canada, British North America, her father, Charles Chouinard, was 28 and her mother, Josephte Mignault dit Labrie, was 21.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Gabriel Duval on 7 November 1820, in Saint-Jean-Port-Joli, L'Islet, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 28 December 1873, in Saint-Aubert, L'Islet, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 77, and was buried in Saint-Aubert, L'Islet, Quebec, Canada.
