1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L1C3-YB8
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie  Marguerite Cottenoir was born on 2 July 1788, in Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, her father, Michel Cotenoir, was 39 and her mother, Marguerite Goguet, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Francois Emmanuel Hubert on 23 October 1809, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1876, in Penetanguishene, Simcoe, Ontario, Canada, at the age of 88.
