1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KLM9-GRH
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Brisset was born on 6 December 1781, in Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Michael Ignace Brissette, was 32 and his mother, Marie Josephe Carpentier, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Delphine Véronique Lavoie on 25 July 1803, in Berthier-en-Haut, Warwick, Lower Canada, British North America. 
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Joseph Brissette 1804–
2 CONT François Xavier Brisset 1806–
2 CONT Louis Gonzague Brissette 1807–
2 CONT Marie Rosalie Brissette 1810–1881
2 CONT Marie Josephine Brissette 1811–1880
2 CONT Prospère Joseph Brissette 1814–1876
2 CONT Zozime Brissette 1817–
2 CONT Mathilde Brissette 1820–
2 CONT Aurelie Brissette 1822–1832
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 11 August 1838, at the age of 56.
