1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KZ4C-CGR
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Pelagie'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Pelagie Turcot was born on 6 September 1778, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Baptiste Turcot, was 34 and her mother, Pelagie Grignon, was 30. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Augustin Mignier dit Lagacé on 8 October 1798, in Saint-Cuthbert, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Charles Mignier dit Lagasse 1803–1804
2 CONT Charles Mignier dit Lagasse 1805–1846
2 CONT Léon Minier dit Lagacé 1806–1883
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Mignier dit Lagasse 1808–1885
2 CONT Domithilde Mignier dit Lagasse 1812–1889
2 CONT Elie Mignier dit Lagasse 1816–1897
2 CONT Marie Euphémie Mignier dit Lagasse 1818–1890
2 CONT Augustin Mignier dit Lagasse 1820–
2 CONT Marie Lucie Mignier-Lagasse 1823–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 20 April 1847, in Saint-Barnabé-Sud, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 68, and was buried in Saint-Barnabé-Sud, Saint-Hyacinthe, Quebec, Canada.
