1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GZFQ-GXB
2 CONT Brief Life History of Josephte'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Josephte Boucher was born on 19 March 1799, in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean-Baptiste Boucher, was 34 and her mother, Élizabeth Lavallée, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Lafond on 12 October 1819, in Sainte-Élisabeth, Joliette, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Berthier, Quebec, Canada in 1851.
