1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:St. François Xavier, Manitoba]]
2 CONT == Biography ==Francois Lafreniere was born on 2 Oct 1834 to [[Lafreniere-179|Antoine-Joseph Lafreniere]] and [[Houle-541|Marguerite Houle]]. Baptism took place at St. François Xavier, Manitoba on 5 Oct 1834.≤ref>"Canada, Manitoba
2 CONC  Church Records, 1800-1959," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L994-WLBV?cc=1992433&wc=M6PR-MPD%3A325478101%2C325478102%2C325478103 : 27 April 2021), St François Xavier Municipality: 
2 CONC St François Xavier > Catholic St FrançoisXavier de la Prairie duCheval Blanc > Baptisms, marriages, burials 1834-1844 vol 1, Record B48 > image 18 of 100; Provincial Archives of Manitoba, Winnipeg.≤/ref>
2 CONT Francois married Isabelle St. Germain (daughter of Francois St. Germain and Louise Morand) at St. François Xavier on 6 Sep 1859.≤ref>"Canada, Manitoba Church Records, 1800-1959," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familys
2 CONC earch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G994-W2QN?cc=1992433&wc=M6PR-MWG%3A325478101%2C325478102%2C325484301 : 27 April 2021), StFrançois Xavier Municipality: St François Xavier > Catholic St François Xavier de la Prairie duCheval Blanc > B
2 CONC aptisms, marriages, burials 1854-1864 vol 3, Record M75 > image 73 of 153; Provincial Archives of Manitoba, Winnipeg.≤/ref> Francois and Isabelle had one child, Ambroise, who married Emerise Houle.≤ref>Morin, Gail. ''Metis Familie
2 CONC s Volume 6 Hourie - Land (p. 274). Kindle Edition.''≤/ref>
2 CONT He passed away in Jan 1860. Burial took place at St. François Xavier on 18 May 1860.≤ref>"Canada, Manitoba Church Records, 1800-1959," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G994-WRZP?cc=1
2 CONC 992433&wc=M6PR-MWG%3A325478101%2C325478102%2C325484301 : 27 April 2021), St François Xavier Municipality: St FrançoisXavier > Catholic St François Xavier de la Prairie duCheval Blanc > Baptisms, marriages, burials 1854-1864 vol 3,
