2 CONT Joseph Cormier aka dit Thibier
2 CONT * Born 16 Apr 1773 in Bécancour, Province de Québec
2 CONT * Son of Jean Cormier and Marie Angélique Ducharme
2 CONT * Brother of Marie Madeleine Cormier, Jean Baptiste (Cormier) Cormier dit Tibier, Alexis Cormier, Marie Louise Cormier, Marie Judith Cormier, Jean-Baptiste Cormier and Marguerite Cormier	
2 CONT * Husband of Marie Louise (Levasseur) Cormier — married 15 Oct 1798 in Bécancour, Bas-Canada
2 CONT * Father of Marie Louise Cormier and Moïse Cormier
2 CONT * Died 20 Apr 1848 at age 75 in Bécancour, Bas-Canada
2 CONT
