1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KZ7S-3P2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Gabriel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Gabriel Lefebvre was born on 15 August 1788, in Saint-Antoine-de-la-Baie-du-Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, his father, Gabriel Lefebvre Descoteaux, was 28 and his mother, Marguerite Lemire, was 19. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife ANTOINETTE LAFOND (1791- ) on 24 January 1814, in Saint Antoine de la Baie du Febvre, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. No children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marguerite Cadoret
2 CONT Female
2 CONT 1816–1854
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT 2 March 1840
2 CONT Saint-Antoine-de-la-Baie-du-Febvre, Quebec
2 CONT They had 11 children
2 CONT Gabriel Lefebvre 1841–
2 CONT Marguerite Lefebvre  1842–
2 CONT Marie Lefebvre 1843–
2 CONT Julie Lefebvre 1845–1927
2 CONT Charles Lefebvre 1845–
2 CONT Joseph Lefebvre 1847–1940
2 CONT Antoine Lefebvre 1848–
2 CONT Hilaire Noel Lefebvre 1850–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Lefebvre 1850–
2 CONT Louis Dieudonne Lefebvre 1850–
2 CONT Hilaire Lefebvre 1851–
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 22 March 1857, in his hometown, at the age of 68.
