1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KGMX-BQF
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre Michel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Michel Parentau was born on 22 September 1787, in Saint-Michel, Yamaska, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, his father, Jean Baptiste Parenteau, was 30 and his mother, Marie Geneviève Cécile Dumas, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Archange Giguère in October 1810, in Saint-Michel-d'Yamaska, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 8 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 3 June 1867, in Saint-Michel-d'Yamaska, Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 79, and was buried in Saint-Michel-d'Yamaska, Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
