1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stephen was born in Grenada as a colonial subject under the British Empire after the British were granted the island under the Treaty of Paris. Thus, Armand has an English first name which he never used, as he alwa
2 CONC ys preferred being known as Armand. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Armand Migrated from Grenada and moved to the United Kingdom where he married Ann Luland in London in 1846. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1851 Armand and Ann lived together in Shadwell, Middlesex, England. Where Armand was a Coppersmith 
2 CONT
2 CONT When Armand died in December 1865 his wife Ann, who was illiterate, registered his death under the name Armand Depridines.
