1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Genevieve Grignon was born 15 DEC 1805 in Ste Genevieve, Berthier, Quebec, Canada , and died AFT 14 MAR 1892. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://wc-rootsweb-com.translate.goog/trees/109046/I06108/genevieve-grignon/registry?_x_tr_sl=fr&_x_tr_tl=en&_x_tr_hl=en&_x_tr_pto=sc
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Savoie on 10 JAN 1832 in Ste Genevieve, Berthierville, Quebec, Canada , son of Marie Judith /Jacques/ and Pierre Louis /Savoy/. He was born 28 JUL 1808 in Ste Genevieve, Berthier, Quebec, Canada , and died 14 MA
2 CONC R 1892 in age 87, St Barthelemy, Berthier, Quebec, Canada . He was buried 16 MAR 1892 in St Barthelemy, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Genevieve /Grignon/ and Pierre /Savoie/ are:
2 CONT # Pierre Savoie was born ABT 1832 in Quebec, Canada .
2 CONT # Gilbert Savoie was born ABT 1833 in Quebec, Canada .
2 CONT # Philomene Savoie was born ABT 1834, and died 17 AUG 1877 in age 33, St Barthelmy de Berthier, Quebec, Canada .
2 CONT # Adeline Savoie was born ABT 1837.
