1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L6FG-776
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean-Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean-Baptiste Proulx was born on 5 November 1779, in Nicolet, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean-Baptiste Proulx, was 30 and his mother, Marie-Josephte Claire Baby, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Madeleine Hebert on 13 July 1806, in Nicolet, Nicolet, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 24 January 1836, in his hometown, at the age of 56, and was buried in Nicolet, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
