1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Reference no.: MOOC8/46.99 ''(see attached document for full Inventory)''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Daniel David Kreynauw'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 April 1832
2 CONT
2 CONT Exh:d the 18th of April 1832, n:o 35
2 CONT
2 CONT Inventory of all the property belonging to the estate of the late Daniel David Kreynauw relinquished by his death ab intestato on the 27th day of March, in the year of our Lord one thousand eight hundred and thirty two in favor of
2 CONC  his children, here undermentioned, procreated by him in marriage with his predeceased wife '''Maria Susanna Durandt,''' viz:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1) Daniel David born on 1 May 1818
2 CONT * 2) Elizabeth Johanna Jacoba born on 24 March 1819
2 CONT * 3) Maria Susanna Wilhelmina born on 1 May 1820
2 CONT * 4) Catharina Johanna Wilhelmina born on 3 August 1822
2 CONT * 5) Martha Carolina Jacoba born on 26 October 1826
2 CONT * 6) David Pieter born on 12 Dec: 1828
2 CONT * 7) Johanna Wilhelmina born on 26 Feb: 1831
2 CONT
2 CONT which aforesaid property having been inventoried on the spot by the undersigned commissioned Masters of the Orphan Board was found to consist as follows, viz:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Slaves'''
2 CONT * Lakey of this Colony about 42 years of age, a husbandman
2 CONT * Jephta (1) of this Colony about 34 years of age, a husbandman
2 CONT * David of Mosambique about 36 years of age, a husbandman
2 CONT * Jephta (2) of Mosambique about 31 years of age
