1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johanna Margaretha de Villiers was a cousin of Jan Daniel de Villiers whom she married  on 2 October 1813 in Paarl. She had been married to Jacobus Philippus Louw, and was his widow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her daughter Anna Cornelia Albertina de Villiers was born 1 January 1816 in Cape Town, South Africa.
