2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT David was the sixth child of David de Villiers and Johanna de Villiers and he was born at Bien Donné, Franschhoek on 21 November 1777. Like his father he also married a de Villiers, namely Aletta Johanna de Villiers. He acquired t
2 CONC he farm De Helderenberg, Stellenbosch, where he farmed and died on 7 September 1833. 
