1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born on the farm Concordia 12 days after his father Daniel passed away. He was baptized  17/11/1754 in Paarl, witnessed by Pieter Joubert and Elizabeth Hugo. He was raised by his stepfather Frans Roussouw, first in
2 CONC  Hexrivier and later Burgersfontein, Groenberg . Pieter Hugo en Hester Olivier lived on the farm De Bakoven 1776 - 1780 and Burgersfontein as from 1780 in area Agter-Groenberg.(Wellington) Had 7 children of which 4 sons and 1 daug
2 CONC hter lived till adulthood. He died as a young man of 39 years on 27/09/1793,his widow died four years later, both were buried in the Paarl. The children were raised with seperate other families. The 4 sons Jan Gysbert, Pieter Fran
2 CONC cois,Daniel and Gideon Jozua became the ancestors of the Hugo families of Bo-Dal,Simonstown and Franschoek respectively.
