0 @N6000000000250401464@ NOTE Pierre Francois Paul was an officer at Fort Ponchartrain (now Detroit). In 1749, he married a Suzanne de Selle (Celles-Duclos) who, in 1765 was granted a separation on the grounds of his dissipation.  Their children, with the exce
1 CONC ption of Charles Francois, were baptized at Ste. Anne's Church, Detroit.  Pierre Francois Paul Denis was killed at the battle of La Colle on the 23rd day of April, 1781, with General James Abercrombie of Stirling Castle.
1 CONT
